@startuml ProductList
' 商品一覧（ProductList）の MVI の流れ
'
' Intent ──▶ Processor ──Action──▶ Reducer ──State──▶ UI
'                │
'                └──SideEffect──▶ UI

title ProductList の流れ

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangleRoundCorner 10

rectangle "UI\n(Android: Compose / iOS: SwiftUI)" as UI
rectangle "ProductListProcessor" as Processor
rectangle "ProductListReducer" as Reducer

UI --> Processor : Intent\n・Load\n・ClickProduct(id)
Processor --> Reducer : Action\n・LoadStarted\n・LoadSucceeded(products)\n・LoadFailed(message)
Reducer --> UI : State\n(ProductListUiState)
Processor --> UI : SideEffect\n・NavigateToDetail(id)

@enduml
